I think there is a "realism" factor now in what the cat can carry.  (and
dog).  In other words, a 40 pound dog can't pick up a 60 pound plate mail.

There are a couple of other improvements in realism now too, but it takes
a while to catch them.  For instance, pets only eat one piece of food at
a time now.  They used to eat a whole pile of corpses in one shot.  Also,
now they will not walk onto a pile with a cursed item in it even to get at
some food.  Before, they would eat the food and then not step on the pile
again.  This makes it easier to get at those orc corpses before the kitty
does.

Also, if you go down a stairway while your cat is still eating, you get
"Hobbes is still eating" and he won't follow you down.  Pets also attack
you if you're wearing a ring of conflict.  Not so good.

Thankfully, pets can still see invisible.

